  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing Stakeholders&#x2019; Preparedness to Address Immediate Humanitarian Needs in Case of Rapid Onset Emergencies, Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The most recent tensions over Ukraine and dynamic events in the country increase the likelihood of a substantial escalation of the conflict. In response to the evolving humanitarian crisis in Ukraine the project is aimed at prepositioning of essential shelter, water, sanitation and hygiene, and non-food item kits and their distribution to most vulnerable displaced and other conflict-affected individuals, building local authorities and civil society capacities on displacement management in urban contexts through training of trainers, practitioners and decision makers, as well as provision of collective centre management equipment and stop-gap provision of multipurpose cash assistance to vulnerable displaced and other conflict-affected individuals.</narrative>
  </description>
